**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
crash.log

# **/.terraform/ means ignore any folder named .terraform, no matter how deep it is.
# *.tfstate means ignore any file ending in .tfstate (like terraform.tfstate).
# *.tfstate.* means ignore files like terraform.tfstate.backup.
# *.tfvars means ignore variable files, which often hold secrets.
# crash.log means ignore Terraform crash logs.

